From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 07:04:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] drm/imagination: Add the BXM-4-64 MC1 of the Allwinner A733

The Allwinner A733 has a BXM-4-64 MC1 with BVNC 36.56.104.183, read from
ROGUE_CR_CORE_ID on the SoC. The driver does not know this BVNC and
refuses to bind without exp_hw_support.

Add it as supported, with its firmware name. The driver keeps no
BVNC-indexed feature table: features, quirks and enhancements come from
the firmware file's device info. That device info matches the one of
36.52.104.182, a BXM-4-64 MC1 already supported, except for BRN 71242,
which the driver only applies to cores without multicore support.

Not covered: rogue_36.56.104.183_v1.fw is not in linux-firmware yet.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: booted on two boards; the driver accepts BVNC
36.56.104.183 without exp_hw_support, loads rogue_36.56.104.183_v1.fw
from the initramfs, and initialises. The firmware file is not in
linux-firmware yet. No render job was submitted.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/imagination/pvr_device.c | 1 +
 drivers/gpu/drm/imagination/pvr_drv.c    | 2 ++
 2 files changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/imagination/pvr_device.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/imagination/pvr_device.c
index 54fe4180c73c..05c2c81521d8 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/imagination/pvr_device.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/imagination/pvr_device.c
@@ -533,6 +533,7 @@ pvr_gpu_support_level(const struct pvr_gpu_id *gpu_id)
 	case PVR_PACKED_BVNC(33, 15, 11, 3):
 	case PVR_PACKED_BVNC(36, 52, 104, 182):
 	case PVR_PACKED_BVNC(36, 53, 104, 796):
+	case PVR_PACKED_BVNC(36, 56, 104, 183):
 		return PVR_GPU_SUPPORTED;
 
 	default:
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/imagination/pvr_drv.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/imagination/pvr_drv.c
index a5b0c970dca5..12e32e71539f 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/imagination/pvr_drv.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/imagination/pvr_drv.c
@@ -46,6 +46,7 @@
  * * AXE-1-16M (33.15.11.3)
  * * BXM-4-64 MC1 (36.52.104.182)
  * * BXS-4-64 MC1 (36.53.104.796)
+ * * BXM-4-64 MC1 (36.56.104.183)
  */
 
 /**
@@ -1539,3 +1540,4 @@ MODULE_IMPORT_NS("DMA_BUF");
 MODULE_FIRMWARE("powervr/rogue_33.15.11.3_v1.fw");
 MODULE_FIRMWARE("powervr/rogue_36.52.104.182_v1.fw");
 MODULE_FIRMWARE("powervr/rogue_36.53.104.796_v1.fw");
+MODULE_FIRMWARE("powervr/rogue_36.56.104.183_v1.fw");
